<article class="env-lemma" id="01P0">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01P0">Lemma <span data-tag="01P0">28.5.8</span>.</a> Any morphism of schemes $f : X \to Y$ with $X$ Noetherian is quasi-compact. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Use Lemma <a href="/tag/01OZ" data-tag="01OZ">28.5.5</a> and use that any subset of a Noetherian topological space is quasi-compact (see Topology, Lemmas <a href="/tag/0052" data-tag="0052">5.9.2</a> and <a href="/tag/04ZA" data-tag="04ZA">5.12.13</a>). 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>